## Questions and potholes

I need to confirm with the Maryland State Board of Elections what I think to be ghost precincts in my map. I need to confirm with them that the geojson file I'm using is conducive to the precinct data from 2024 and hasn't been changed. Based on the metadata from the county site where I downloaded the files, it doesn't seem like it has been changed since 2024, but I need to be sure. 

I also want to confirm I addressed ballot results listed as overvote, undervote or write-in correctly and that filtering them out as I did doesn't cause in inaccuracies. When I filter them out, my results by candidate are slightly different to the ones listed on the official elections board website.

## Goal for completion

I would like to have this done, at the latest, by the time of the primary on June 23 for timeliness.

